; Second dictionary (message words)
;
; A second word list, in exactly the same format as #R$6040, holding words that only the game ever prints: the vocabulary of fights, weather and narration. The
; player cannot type these words (the parser does not look here), but messages refer to them the same way, by offset from #R$6000. For example BROADSIDE is
; $84F, DEFENSE $8A6, EFFORT $8CF, FATAL $90C, GLANCING $94C, INEFFECTIVE $9A0, BULBOUS $858 and PALE $A70.
; .
; Keeping these out of the main dictionary made the parser's search shorter and stopped players from typing words that had no meaning as commands.
