 $B995 DEFB $84,$FF,$04,$04,$00,$00,$00,$00                         ; {Room 4: lonelands. lit, "in". Exits: W to 1 through object 5, E to 5, N to 5, NE to 6
 $B99D DEFB $6F,$B4,$04,$05,$01,$03,$00,$05                         ;
